Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Split up and find the intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them on sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they\Nhaven't found the intruders yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?\NCan you walk to the emergency exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! The fighting\Ncould spread here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out before the Oni come!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy won't let those Oni get us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:33.87,Italics,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:34.95,Italics,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.58,Italics,,0,0,0,,Torikai's in really bad shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:43.71,Italics,,0,0,0,,I can't attack or even fight back\Nif I can't make a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:47.72,Italics,,0,0,0,,I need just one second\Nto create one from my blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:50.39,Italics,,0,0,0,,but this bastard stops me\Nat the speed of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.10,Italics,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:54.01,Italics,,0,0,0,,Isn't Hirunuma with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:55.85,Italics,,0,0,0,,He's fighting somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:58.94,Italics,,0,0,0,,And he's having a pretty rough time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.37,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Can't control the BACKLASH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.80,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Three, two, one, full throttle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:28.38,Italics,song,0,0,0,,With a pulsing, chaotic beat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:31.05,Italics,song,0,0,0,,My eyes make the call
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.13,0:01:32.97,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Justice or Evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.89,Italics,song,0,0,0,,- Make your choice\N- Hold on to your pride
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:38.48,Italics,song,0,0,0,,- Make your choice\N- Though hesitation still dances
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.14,Italics,song,0,0,0,,- Make your choice\N- This wound won't close
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.23,0:01:43.86,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Oh, God, answer me, please
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:45.02,Italics,song,0,0,0,,The scale, the speed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.11,0:01:46.52,Italics,song,0,0,0,,My brain catches fire, burning up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:48.19,Italics,song,0,0,0,,In or out of the ring,\Nshout with the crew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:49.19,Italics,song,0,0,0,,With you till the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.28,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Got a feeling,\Nno sense of danger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:51.78,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Right to the skull, oh, no, no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:53.28,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Take a wild dive beyond imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:54.28,Italics,song,0,0,0,,With you till the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.37,0:01:58.75,Italics,song,0,0,0,,It burst from my heart with a thump
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:01.16,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Dreams, love, all that stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:05.38,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Might have to censor some of it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:09.09,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Huh? Now why am I crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:11.01,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Feel the BACKLASH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:14.26,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Mix blazing ideals with every taboo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:16.30,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Feel the BACKLASH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:19.60,Italics,song,0,0,0,,I wanna swim with you\Nat the critical point
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:21.60,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Feel the BACKLASH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:24.77,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Let every last trace of loneliness\Nand happiness explode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:29.07,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Show me what love is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:32.74,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Before I know it,\Nhere comes the BACKLASH again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:41.08,On Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 07:\NTHE GENERAL'S BACK
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed\Nyou're still alive after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.13,Italics,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.92,Italics,,0,0,0,,That one really did a number on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.18,Italics,,0,0,0,,Torikai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:56.09,Italics,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.31,Italics,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.39,0:03:00.97,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.56,Italics,,0,0,0,,Just hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away! Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,An attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:16.36,Italics,,0,0,0,,Torikai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:22.70,Italics,,0,0,0,,I joined you to fight by your side,\Nnot to be dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead. You'd better catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it. Don't get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you communicate with your comrades?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The General was worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him to go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps that was\Nhis way of abandoning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A leader must consider every possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.49,0:03:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:06.50,Italics,,0,0,0,,He's laughing? This isn't a trap, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have very different ideas\Nof what a leader is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet your boss\Njust sits on his ass at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna follow some general\Nwho sits back and hides behind his pawns!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I sure as hell\Ndon't wanna be one of those pawns!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:58.05,Italics,,0,0,0,,This is bad!\NMy connection to Torikai's getting weaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:03.39,Italics,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:05.35,Italics,,0,0,0,,Torikai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Momotaro are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.34,Italics,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:39.55,Italics,,0,0,0,,don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a couple of brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the smoke signal.\NLed us right to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting desperate, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're running again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our General...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,is always the first to charge into battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't care how dangerous it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He charges right ahead,\Neven with his lousy sense of direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike your boss, he's got\Nthe guts to lead from the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand\Nyour devotion to your general.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a duty to protect the public!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Extermination complete.\NFor real this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My job...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is to watch the General's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:43.88,Italics,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:45.84,Italics,,0,0,0,,How did that not kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! It's gotta be easier\Nto just die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.81,0:07:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's counting on me to watch his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:08:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved my life,\Ngave me a reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe him a debt that I can never repay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So I made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd get stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so he wouldn't have to worry\Nabout the rest of us behind him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,strong enough\Nto watch the General's back...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so he could keep looking straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.01,0:08:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll turn around and come back for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. Not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.33,Italics,,0,0,0,,That smoke is a real nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't have time for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is such a pain.\NCould you just die already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:11.01,Italics,,0,0,0,,Kumo Momota controls cigarette smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:13.18,Italics,,0,0,0,,He can also harden it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:16.97,Italics,,0,0,0,,His ability only works while he's smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's such a bother, why not just die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.23,0:09:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,After you tell me where the captive Oni\Nare and what you're researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't laze around when you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like a double this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think even Oni blood\Ncan heal this wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're about to die,\NI'll let you in on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where the Oni are\Nor what they're researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really interested, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave the hard stuff to the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm happy being number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I'd lose to someone so hollow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:24.17,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma? Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.63,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:29.88,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No response.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh! Keep quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone's here to rescue us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Test subjects don't get to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts. It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there until it heals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's coming to rescue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly everyone from the colony is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They take a few of us away\Nalmost every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.55,0:11:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust people easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.32,0:11:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you were a Momotaro,\Nwe could have made a good team!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can respect a man with conviction!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're an Oni!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're reborn\Nas a Momotaro next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand bigots like you\Nwho don't even realize what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In my next life, I'll be me again,\Nand I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be me in every life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:11:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll love my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And lose them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll live my life\Nwith the friends I meet along the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't underestimate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This will obliterate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All your evil and malice\Nwill be wiped away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you should be able\Nto come back as a Momotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be over in an instant!\NYou won't suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You think all I've been doing\Nis running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in making\Nsomething that won't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I decided to put every drop of blood\NI had into making this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I scattered my blood around on purpose,\Nbuilding it up bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This one takes some time to prepare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood Eclipse Release...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Avian Blood Formation: Pteranodon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.85,0:13:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.19,0:13:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go on living as an Oni!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be happier dying\Nand coming back as a Momotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn\Nabout some life I've never lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of the friends I've made!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's the life I've lived\Nthat gave me that pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.45,0:13:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd taken even one different turn,\NI wouldn't be here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't act like the life I'm proud of\Nis something to pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't move!\NYou'll get caught in it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I can't afford to lose, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To make this a world\Nwhere people can live in safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep on winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.87,Italics,,0,0,0,,Shit. I'm running out of strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This might have ended differently\Nif you'd been at full strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:36.67,Italics,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:37.88,Italics,,0,0,0,,I can't hold him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.89,0:14:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:49.39,On Top,sign,0,0,0,,OINK!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What? He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.90,0:15:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck was on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You got carried away\Nand forgot to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Extermination complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,See? That was my line after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:42.07,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:45.07,Italics,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Hirunuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:46.95,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,People try way too hard\Nto give their lives meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why everything gets so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak die,\Nand whoever dies is the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:15:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not leave it at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight minutes and 34 seconds of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.47,0:16:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked way too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd know where the Oni are\Nor what they're researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.35,0:16:13.93,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:15.60,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, the Chief\Nwas all excited about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about "Lightning."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,put leeches in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I blew your whole arm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What you blew off\Nwas a prosthetic arm made of leeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have real arms to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,An arm made of leeches?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, the leeches\Nin your stomach are poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you know,\Nand I'll remove them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, or the poison will eat\Nthrough your stomach and kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.12,Italics,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.21,0:17:22.33,Italics,,0,0,0,,I could destroy ordinary leeches\Nwith my smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:25.17,Italics,,0,0,0,,but that won't stop the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one sick bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what can you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.85,Italics,,0,0,0,,Shit. I don't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:41.60,Italics,,0,0,0,,I only overheard the word "Lightning."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:44.86,Italics,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be bothered\Nto listen to the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:49.07,Italics,,0,0,0,,Shit! Shit, shit, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:53.82,Italics,,0,0,0,,I should have just sucked it up\Nand listened!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:58.33,Italics,,0,0,0,,I have to sell him this bluff\Nso he'll save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:17:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you this lab's secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But neutralize the poison first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't actually know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have bothered to pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.61,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.61,0:18:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to kill you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:46.17,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.46,Italics,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:50.51,Italics,,0,0,0,,Finally! You answered!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:53.26,Italics,,0,0,0,,Torikai's hurt pretty badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:54.68,Italics,,0,0,0,,Go pick him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.76,Italics,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:19:00.85,Italics,,0,0,0,,You kept calling,\Nso I thought you were worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:05.48,Italics,,0,0,0,,It looked rough,\Nbut I knew how you were holding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:09.36,Italics,,0,0,0,,And you're strong, Hirunuma.\NWhat would I have to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:12.74,Italics,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Lightning."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.08,Italics,,0,0,0,,Torikai! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:26.50,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hey, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.13,Italics,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:30.63,Italics,,0,0,0,,I took out the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.13,Italics,,0,0,0,,But are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.59,Italics,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:39.14,Italics,,0,0,0,,Don't think I'll be fighting again\Nfor a while, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:41.01,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'll find somewhere to hide and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:42.98,Italics,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.15,Italics,,0,0,0,,Had you worried, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.65,0:19:50.15,Italics,,0,0,0,,No! I had faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:53.03,Italics,,0,0,0,,I found some data, but it's encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:54.90,Italics,,0,0,0,,I can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:58.37,Italics,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll\Nhave to go upstairs after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:01.08,Italics,,0,0,0,,That was always the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:03.91,Italics,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:06.21,Italics,,0,0,0,,Hirunuma's on his way to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:07.92,Italics,,0,0,0,,Catch up when you're able!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:09.42,Italics,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyo! Yaoroshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! If you go all out, General,\Nthe Oni will...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The way is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:28.19,Italics,,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in a Momotaro lab is a Momotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a kid inside her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It carries Momotaro blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be another Momotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll eliminate them both!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.91,0:21:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaoroshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:39.13,Italics,song,0,0,0,,"How've you been lately?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.22,0:21:42.01,Italics,song,0,0,0,,"Well..." What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.09,0:21:47.97,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Who gets to decide\Nwhat the answer is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:50.77,Italics,song,0,0,0,,No matter\Nhow hard I search
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:53.65,Italics,song,0,0,0,,I still can't hear\Nthe voice inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:59.99,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Who is that voice\Nmeant for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:08.45,Italics,song,0,0,0,,"I'm fine" is only a brave face,\Nits meaning turned inside out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:12.58,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Words playing\Nhide-and-seek
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.55,0:22:18.46,Italics,song,0,0,0,,You won't cry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.55,0:22:22.63,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Not even when you're all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:26.85,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Your tears could spill over any moment now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:31.98,Italics,song,0,0,0,,You can't\Nerase them
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:35.48,Italics,song,0,0,0,,All the tiny footprints
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:38.53,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Left by\Nyour timid self
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:45.78,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Even today, somewhere in this world,\None trembling hand is holding another
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:48.95,Italics,song,0,0,0,,As one lonely soul joins the next
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:52.25,Italics,song,0,0,0,,The world\Nbecomes a circle
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:10.97,On Top,sign,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME\NONE'S OWN WAY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:13.97,On Top,,0,0,0,,

